  - timestamp: 2026-04-22 21:39:45
    panelType: Vehicle Customization
    userPrompt: Setup for track day
    explanation: 'Track day setup optimized for a lightweight 850kg RWD turbocharged
      vehicle: Increased torque to 380Nm for better acceleration out of corners.
      Raised engine inertia to 0.08 for smoother power delivery under braking zones.
      Tightened shift timing (0.1s, 8500 RPM threshold) for precise gear changes.
      Stiffened suspension spring to 54000 (36% increase) and damping to 4860 for
      reduced body roll and better turn-in response. Increased antiroll forces front/rear
      (1200/1400) for more predictable handling. Boosted downforce to 120 for improved
      high-speed stability. Shifted to Realistic friction curves for authentic grip
      behavior. Reduced stability helper strengths (0.15-0.2) for more driver engagement
      while keeping safety nets active. Brake torque increased front to 3200 for
      better stopping power without lock-up via ABS.'
    appliedJson: "{\n  \"vehicleConfig\": {\n    \"mass\": 850\n  },\n  \"engine\":
      {\n    \"maximumTorqueAsNM\": 380,\n    \"maxEngineRPM\": 9500,\n    \"engineInertia\":
