      \"tractionHelperStrength\": 0.2,\n    \"angularDragHelperStrength\": 0.15\n 
      },\n  \"vehicleBehavior\": \"Race\",\n  \"explanation\": \"Track day setup
      optimized for a lightweight 850kg RWD turbocharged vehicle: Increased torque
      to 380Nm for better acceleration out of corners. Raised engine inertia to 0.08
      for smoother power delivery under braking zones. Tightened shift timing (0.1s,
      8500 RPM threshold) for precise gear changes. Stiffened suspension spring to
      54000 (36% increase) and damping to 4860 for reduced body roll and better turn-in
      response. Increased antiroll forces front/rear (1200/1400) for more predictable
      handling. Boosted downforce to 120 for improved high-speed stability. Shifted
      to Realistic friction curves for authentic grip behavior. Reduced stability
      helper strengths (0.15-0.2) for more driver engagement while keeping safety
      nets active. Brake torque increased front to 3200 for better stopping power
      without lock-up via ABS.\"\n}"
