  - timestamp: 2026-04-22 21:38:40
    panelType: Vehicle Customization
    userPrompt: More stability
    explanation: "Increased stability across multiple systems: enabled angularDragHelper
      to prevent spins, boosted helper strengths (steerHelper 0.3\u21920.5, tractionHelper
      0.35\u21920.6), increased antiroll forces front/rear for better body control,
      improved sideways friction (stiffness 1\u21921.2, grip values +0.2) for more
      cornering grip, added downForce (10\u219250) for speed-dependent stability,
      and stiffened suspension (spring +20%, damper +20%) for a planted feel. All
      stability aids remain active (ABS, ESP, TCS on)."
